{"slug":"geometry-football-and-the-world-cup-final","publishable":true,"draft":true,"wordCount":640,"referenceCount":2,"seoTerm":"geometry football cup final","findings":[{"severity":"warning","gate":"standards-cleared","code":"attention-preserve-modality","message":"surface \"Spain's Geometry Meets Messi's Magic in World Cup Final Showdown. Spain and Argentina will meet at MetLife Stadium for the 2026 FIFA World Cup final â€” a fitting finale between the world's two highest-ranked teams, according to 'Tactically complete' Spain vs an inspired Messi-led Argentina. Both teams arrive undefeated after seven matches, though they approach the contest with fundamentally different tactical philosophies.\" uses certainty language for interprets warrant"}],"kind":"producing-content.standards-review"}

